## 3. Ollama and the first model

Install Ollama. Pull only the live embedding model now; the study models come later, one at a time (issue #9):

```sh
ollama pull bge-m3
```

Keep at least 8 GB of free disk before any pull. Never call a model whose name ends in `-cloud`: it sends data off the machine.

Check: `ollama list` shows `bge-m3`. If a 4B Qwen model is already installed, note whether it is `qwen3-embedding:4b` (a study candidate for issue #10) or a chat model such as `qwen3:4b` (not a study candidate).
